          "id": "1762206372492",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1762206372493_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Extract the user input from the following: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.userQuery}} \nIf the supply document header number (that usually appears after the supply type) related data is present extract it into `SupplySourceHeaderNumber` output. Note: For On Hand Supply there won't be any supply document header number leave it empty.\nIf the supply document line number related data is present extract it into the `SupplySourceLineNumber` output. Note: For On Hand Supply there won't be any supply line number leave it empty.\nIf  the supply document related data is present then extract the `SupplySourceType` and `SupplySourceTypeId` refer below. If no supply source type is mentioned set `SupplySourceTypeId` as an empty string \"\".\nIf ItemNumber is not explicitly mentioned set it as empty string.\n| DOCUMENT TYPE | SUPPLY SOURCE TYPE         | SUPPLY SOURCE TYPE ID |  \n            | ------------- | -------------------------- | --------------------- |  \n            | Supply        | On hand                    | 13                    |  \n            | Supply        | Purchase order             | 1                     |  \n            | Supply        | Purchase order requisition | 17                    |  \n            | Supply        | Transfer order             | 8                     |  \n            | Supply        | Transfer order return      | 18                    |  \n            | Supply        | Work order                 | 5                     |\nUse natural language procesing to identify the values for the each attribute of the following list:\n\nReservationRequirementDate\nReservationQuantity\nDemandSourceHeaderNumber\nDemandSourceLineNumber (this is alphanumeric data that uniquely identifies a Demand Lines for a specific Demand Document).\nReservationUnitOfMeasure\nItemNumber (is NOT the same as DemandSourceLineNumber or SupplySourceLineNumber)\nSupplySourceTypeId\nSupplySourceHeaderNumber\nSupplySourceLineNumber"
            },
            {
              "id": "1762206372493_2",
              "name": "temperature",
              "type": "number",
              "value": ""
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"SupplySourceLineNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"SupplySourceHeaderNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"DemandSourceHeaderNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ReservationRequirementDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ReservationQuantity\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"DemandSourceLineNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ReservationUnitOfMeasure\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ItemNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"SupplySourceTypeId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "isCandidateToAutoreserve"
