                  "code": "CA_NO_ONHAND",
                  "id": "1762982760593",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1762982760595_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "Conditional logic (evaluate first):\n- RequestedQuantity = {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.RequestedQuantity}}\n- Available values:\n  - TO = {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.AvailableToReserveTransferOrder}}\n  - TOR = {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.AvailableToReserveTransferOrderReturn}}\n  - WO = {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.AvailableToReserveWorkOrder}}\n- A supply type qualifies if Available > RequestedQuantity.\n- Rendering rules:\n  - Always include the “no on-hand” message.\n  - If one or more types qualify:\n    - Include only qualifying types in supplyOptions.\n    - Include only matching suggestedActions.\n  - If none qualify:\n    - Do not include supplyOptions or suggestedActions.\n    - Include noAlternateSupplyMessage: \"No alternate supply exceeds the requested quantity.\"\n\nJSON output template (render only qualifying entries):\n{\n  \"message\": \"Unfortunately there is no on-hand available for this line: {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.DemandSourceLineNumber}}.\",\n  \"requestedQuantity\": \"{{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.RequestedQuantity}}\",\n  \"alternateSupplyHeader\": \"Alternate supply exceeding requested quantity\",\n  \"supplyOptions\": [\n    {\n      \"supplyType\": \"Transfer Order\",\n      \"available\": \"{{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.AvailableToReserveTransferOrder}}\",\n      \"requested\": \"{{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.RequestedQuantity}}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"supplyType\": \"Transfer Order Return\",\n      \"available\": \"{{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.AvailableToReserveTransferOrderReturn}}\",\n      \"requested\": \"{{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.RequestedQuantity}}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"supplyType\": \"Work Order\",\n      \"available\": \"{{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.AvailableToReserveWorkOrder}}\",\n      \"requested\": \"{{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.RequestedQuantity}}\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"suggestedActions\": [\n    \"Create reservation for DemandSourceTypeId: {{$context.$variables.DemandSourceTypeId}}, DemandSourceHeaderNumber: {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.DemandSourceHeaderNumber}} with supply type of Transfer Order.\",\n    \"Create reservation for DemandSourceTypeId: {{$context.$variables.DemandSourceTypeId}}, DemandSourceHeaderNumber: {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.DemandSourceHeaderNumber}} with supply type of Transfer Order Return.\",\n    \"Create reservation for DemandSourceTypeId: {{$context.$variables.DemandSourceTypeId}}, DemandSourceHeaderNumber: {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.DemandSourceHeaderNumber}} with supply type of Work Order.\"\n  ]\n}\n\nNotes:\n- Include only those objects in supplyOptions where Available > RequestedQuantity.\n- Include only the corresponding strings in suggestedActions for the qualifying supply types.\n- If none qualify, output instead:\n{\n  \"message\": \"Unfortunately there is no on-hand available for this document: {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.DemandSourceHeaderNumber}} of demand source type {{$context.$variables.DemandSourceTypeId}} and line: {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_RSV_FOR_LINE.$currentItem.DemandSourceLineNumber}}.\",\n  \"noAlternateSupplyMessage\": \"No alternate supply exceeds the requested quantity.\"\n}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
