              "id": "1762557771004_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Based on the following data: {{$context.$nodes.CA_FETCH_DEMAND_DOCUMENTS.$output.output}} \nFilter the data based on this query: {{$context.$variables.UserQuery}}  and extract it\nif DemandSourceHeaderNumber extract value into `DemandSourceHeaderNumber` output\nif DemandSourceHeaderId extract value into `DemandSourceHeaderId` output\nif DemandSourceLineId extract value into `DemandSourceLineId` output\nif DemandSourceLineNumber extract value into `DemandSourceLineNumber` output\nset today's date in format 'YYYY-MM-DD'   value into `RequirementDate` output\nif ReservationStatus extract value into `ReservationStatus` output\nif AvailableToReserveOnhand extract value into `AvailableToReserveOnhand` output\nif AvailableToReserveTransferOrder extract value into `AvailableToReserveTransferOrder` output\nif AvailableToReserveTransferOrderReturn extract value into `AvailableToReserveTransferOrderReturn` output\nif AvailableToReserveWorkOrder extract value into `AvailableToReserveWorkOrder` output\nif ReservationUnitOfMeasure extract value into `ReservationUnitOfMeasure` output\nif InventoryItemId extract value into `InventoryItemId ` output otherwise output \"\"\nif RequestedQuantity extract value into `RequestedQuantity` output\nif DemandSourceTypeId extract value into `DemandSourceTypeId` output\nif OrganizationId extract value into `OrganizationId` output\nset 13 into `SupplySourceTypeId` output"
            },
            {
